   "grammarNote": {
    "en": "An N3 family story: parents visiting on a short-term family visa — and the charming surprises through the eyes of elderly Vietnamese seeing Japan for the first time. Welcoming your parents to see where you live is a dream shared by many Vietnamese abroad.",
